## RunRunner body and FFI invocation

Shipped in Slice 5b. The body resolves the runner plugin from `Resource<ExtensionHost>` plus `Column<PluginEntry>` (finds the entry with the runner-role bit set, resolves its `&Library`, extracts the runner vtable from the descriptor via `runner_vtable_from_library`), marshals `RunScope` from Resources at the FFI boundary, calls `execute_scope`, writes the returned `NamPayload` into `Column<Nam>` at slot zero. On failure (descriptor missing, vtable absent, AbiStatus != Ok), writes `WuDiagnostic { source: WuDiagnosticSource::RunRunner }` to `Column<WuDiagnostic>`. AccessSet extended per the Slice 5b DOC CL. Initial body ships with placeholders for workspace_root, surface, host_ctx, and FileEntry enrichment fields per the four still-deferred Slice 5a BACKLOG entries below.

